comments.body:
@jamorham, not sure, but it looks like for me that the standard Text-Size while rendering the SeekBar is bigger than the other Preferences types (seeing that in all Prefs where the seekbar is used).  Maybe this should be streamlined, but I'm not sure where this will be handled... 

@dave1812 , Substratum is for Endusers, and gives the possibility to change the look and feel of your smartphone in a very deep manner (also System-settings and so on), and unfortunately this can cause also a lot of UI issues. Nevertheless you don't use it, so this is not a issue. 
As there is a workaround to see the value, this issue looks like not very important. But I'm pretty sure if Jamorham, me or one other have some time this will be checked.
